     :int32)`;;
definition ve_vk_X `ve_vk_X (S:num->int32) i c = (word_sx (ve_vk_xn S i c):int64)`;;
definition ve_vk_C `ve_vk_C (mdl:num->int32) j = (word_sx (mdl (16 + j)):int64)`;;
